            <div xml:id="m-dae516ae-9489-4e26-ba12-a8dffd26c8b5">
              <lg xml:id="m-12e79ab1-48f0-4b4f-90de-64c801703fb7">
                <l xml:id="m-4eaab5b0-5016-453f-9655-c1085e21cef8" facs="#m-67ae00e1-4702-4df9-b3a8-6cc69b6d15e9" label="ambiguous">408</l><l xml:id="m-dcb4d402-7fe2-42d9-9d15-e128d0e9d391" facs="#m-415c3e04-dc31-4028-baa1-3e3d2abe3243" label="text-like">The Nativity of our Lord.</l><l xml:id="m-d2d1d2ab-c7c5-4d44-94f3-cfa306dec4b5" facs="#m-ab2cbeed-fd64-406e-8822-62a762826f09" label="text-like">THE MASS OF THE DAY.</l><l xml:id="m-55ce0704-9f6a-4081-afee-0325ae06b2e6" facs="#m-a3ff8365-aeaa-4caa-9db8-3c0312818306" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-088664a6-a063-437b-87dc-ef9f9257a3c8" facs="#m-5677aded-ff3e-46ba-88d6-141ff4095607" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-c612a950-84bc-42c6-a254-1c1e6d93f491" facs="#m-49cf26d1-4d29-4df3-9fb9-dc610e2f1cfe" label="ambiguous">P</l><l xml:id="m-4c14286d-9c78-4166-a31d-af1b7dff4373" facs="#m-77c65c4e-8114-4c2b-b6e7-585f145b8dbc" label="lyrics-like">U-er * ná-tus est nó¬ bis, et fí- li- us dá-tus est</l><l xml:id="m-88d7a2ae-b26d-45d7-86c1-1aba8862b9e6" facs="#m-9ce2a18b-824e-446f-a107-e9c606e3ef2b" label="lyrics-like">nó- bis: cú-jus impé-ri- um super hû-me-rum é¬</l><l xml:id="m-9806d73a-e973-47c8-8ba1-27e124c6fbf5" facs="#m-4dff6662-f497-4780-ae1c-95c0da522065" label="lyrics-like">jus: et vocá- bi-tur nómen é¬</l><l xml:id="m-383fdd4f-bb9e-40c1-8063-88b040902e15" facs="#m-ac2c1de6-75ad-44e4-9e8d-8b23a85b3e11" label="lyrics-like">jus, mágni consí¬</l><l xml:id="m-3969b7f2-8088-4302-bdba-19952af4afac" facs="#m-30ceb82c-07fe-4685-a742-634e8eb4becf" label="lyrics-like">li- 1 Ange- lus. Ps. Can-tá-te Dómino cánti-cum nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-1136cd87-0be4-4172-94a7-3af098b0132b" facs="#m-4acd5289-2bae-48c1-bc89-123400e5cc9f" label="lyrics-like">vum : “ qui-a mi-rabí-li-a fé- cit. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-5f1d820e-5fb0-42bc-9bcb-92cbe7460979" facs="#m-ec050977-3cb2-46a4-826f-a8e38e93fa8d" label="ambiguous">E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-218ba84a-5311-4cb3-a626-4536dbdd5f70" facs="#m-5f87a188-cfd6-4434-9f12-226d5545faaf" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-55f72b23-9151-40d4-bd98-8c1bd6da8999" facs="#m-6910999f-93c7-49c4-8b36-16d386afd227" label="lyrics-like">(VOncéde, quaésumus omnípotens ] quos sub peccáti jugo vetústa sér¬</l><l xml:id="m-da903b80-e95c-48de-aefd-81d5f8a2d3fc" facs="#m-efc6c819-80c1-40d3-854a-177e802baa3a" label="lyrics-like">vitus tenet. Per eúmdem Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-95595c45-5505-4089-82c9-4365a1d53f46" facs="#m-d237092a-9f99-4db6-b270-8f163263d3f0" label="lyrics-like">UDeus: f ut nos Unigéniti tui</l><l xml:id="m-95e79915-820f-4231-92d0-581d5eed7d6f" facs="#m-d0efee11-b91d-4516-aaba-70886e35317b" label="ambiguous">nova per carnem Nativitas liberet;"</l><l xml:id="m-dff3efbb-3281-4341-92ce-433ec3837458" facs="#m-1e377d0e-feb5-43c9-a72b-9752680ca7d1" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Hebraeos. Hebr. T.</l><l xml:id="m-3f2d69ce-c39f-4c37-9912-9293ea01b601" facs="#m-44351218-800d-42d4-8728-2dba374fcc35" label="lyrics-like">Uitifáriam, multísque modis! prae illis nomen haereditávit. Cui</l><l xml:id="m-ba2ce3b8-e921-410d-a660-1f53c523f9e1" facs="#m-f022b19d-ceeb-47c2-82cd-e90610ee47ce" label="lyrics-like">enim dixit aliquándo Angelórum:</l><l xml:id="m-1cbfc98f-9e14-46fe-adf9-df77479c629c" facs="#m-d80b6920-2b3a-492f-9cf7-c52db8d64e61" label="lyrics-like">34C olim Deus loquens pátribus in</l><l xml:id="m-39e4eba1-5e8d-4a4d-8c43-4d4dc9a6efea" facs="#m-ad7743e9-d2c0-4947-8cae-035087096193" label="lyrics-like">prophétis: novissime diébus istis</l><l xml:id="m-3bc7cf75-c781-44b5-90ef-86f4c2275389" facs="#m-f74afc84-bcbe-44a0-aae6-213d4bf9f088" label="lyrics-like">Filius meus es tu, ego hódie génui</l><l xml:id="m-285474f9-fe00-4e48-b999-f4078e334784" facs="#m-fa3d21c0-7d36-41f6-bf34-5d739a0df306" label="ambiguous">te? Et rursum: Ego ero illi in pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-2c7ff6eb-4f5e-443d-bda2-abfe0908105b" facs="#m-5d3e73cf-9065-4602-be03-dac24d6ec1ff" label="lyrics-like">locútus est nobis in Filio, quem con¬</l><l xml:id="m-f650faf0-d795-4ee1-a81e-d9659d61e8af" facs="#m-a6f4b07f-db01-4243-89da-e14fe4a913dd" label="ambiguous">trem, et ipse erit mihi in filium? Et</l><l xml:id="m-a476c8c1-09fd-4346-bfda-e97dc0eb5620" facs="#m-80487d6b-c5b5-4959-b236-59e9733bb02b" label="lyrics-like">stituit haerédem universórum, per</l><l xml:id="m-aa3f19eb-b0a4-4a4b-8394-8f6884980608" facs="#m-1aff3bb0-0400-4441-a1ba-876b5e768a7b" label="lyrics-like">cum iterũm introdúcit primogéni¬</l><l xml:id="m-454e2f7e-eb2c-41a3-8c34-2d6054f80741" facs="#m-003244a9-2136-4e55-8ecb-1eac864edc51" label="lyrics-like">quem fecit et saécula: qui cum sit</l><l xml:id="m-bc8725c9-0c4b-49c8-90df-bf676448a7d8" facs="#m-0a646f16-5219-4f6e-b311-af4bf3367c94" label="lyrics-like">splendor glóriae, et figúra substán-tum in orbem terrae, dicit : Et adó¬</l><l xml:id="m-59bb349b-68d0-4517-bdd3-f0178f27b2a7" facs="#m-375f28ca-8025-4fbc-8e61-e0621d89930d" label="lyrics-like">tiae ejus, portánsque ómnia verbo rent eum omnes Angeli Dei. Et ad</l><l xml:id="m-cea7f016-31bb-4a32-af09-dc00f1bc2f42" facs="#m-e1930d1f-3297-44bb-a7eb-cefc6ec4da36" label="ambiguous">Angelos quidem dicit : Qui facit An¬</l><l xml:id="m-0080bd3d-fab7-4d86-81ed-4f60b15d4a9e" facs="#m-217859e5-32b2-4b0e-a0f5-32baa914cb09" label="lyrics-like">virtútis suae, purgatiónem peccató¬</l><l xml:id="m-04d2b4b7-7a01-4bb2-9692-a3b1e2331447" facs="#m-c8c9105b-5c35-4187-a2b3-9107b6b4bebe" label="lyrics-like">rum fáciens, sedet ad déxteram ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-c7d6e0a0-2a31-46ab-91d4-b7b9a37a93e6" facs="#m-83fb99aa-60c0-41fa-be25-4364ed38d57e" label="lyrics-like">gelos suos spíritus, et minístros suos</l><l xml:id="m-b2edb6e1-fb4f-4218-9fea-b63a4ac630c2" facs="#m-040b17c5-1376-4888-b21e-9003c0c08c14" label="ambiguous">Hlammam ignis. Ad Filium autem:</l><l xml:id="m-56f26e87-ab3e-4746-9157-764defacff88" facs="#m-fb313706-ee70-4446-8393-edd51bcc03d7" label="lyrics-like">jestátis in excélsis: tanto mélior</l><l xml:id="m-a5b86be0-3ab8-47d4-a495-08c699d1d5da" facs="#m-5525b0b0-6d01-4d8c-b1ef-1f7f89a7095d" label="lyrics-like">Angelis efféctus, quanto differéntius Thronus tuus, Deus, in saéculum</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
